# AGENTS.md

Instructions for AI coding agents working in this repository.

**Universal entry:** **`AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`** (all AI tools). This file adds project specifics.

## Session start

When **`docs/AGENT_SESSION_START.md`** exists, read it on the **first turn** of a new session before substantial work. It reports stale vs fresh context and lists required absolute paths.

## Project

- **Name:** {{PROJECT_NAME}}
- **Version file:** {{VERSION_FILE}}
- **Test command:** `run_tests.bat`
- **Audit command:** `run_audit.cmd` → report per `docs/AUDIT.md` (Fix + Improve only)
- **CI build:** `build_ci.bat` with `BUILD_NOPAUSE=1`
- **Product backlog:** `docs/ROADMAP.md` (parked work — not audit Improve)
- **Work queue:** `docs/WORK_QUEUE.md` (maintainer radar — stable WQ IDs; see `generic-work-queue-discipline.mdc`)
- **Known limitations:** `docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md` (informational)

## Stale agent context

If an audit reports **Agent context stale / never refreshed / unreadable**, do not hand the user a
command to type. **Offer to run `Refresh-AgentContext.cmd` for this project** and run it once they
approve, then read the regenerated `docs/AGENT_REFRESH.md` in the same turn. Details in
`AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`.

## Agent runs commands (user verifies)

You run sync, verify, test, and fix commands; the user reviews output and may pivot. Do not offload executable work as "please run X." See **`AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`** and portable **`GENERIC_RULES.md`** § agent-defaults-always.

## Before long shell commands

Use **agent-hygiene** MCP when available:

1. `agent_hygiene_full_check`
2. After force-kill: `cleanup_orphan_agent_processes` (`dry_run=True` first)

Without MCP: `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\AgentStarterPack\pack\scripts\cleanup-orphan-processes.ps1`

## Audits

Say **audit**. Agent runs `run_audit.cmd` and follows **`docs/AUDIT.md`**. Report only **Fix** and **Improve**.

Do not use Phase A/B, add-ons menus, or audit overlay rules.

## GUI tests (if applicable)

- Skill **agent-gui-test-hygiene**
- `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen`
- Full suite: `run_tests.bat` or `run_audit.cmd` (includes tests)

## Builds (agents)

```bat
set BUILD_NOPAUSE=1
call build_ci.bat
```

